Files: subprojects/packagecache/vl-sigv4-*.tar.xz
       subprojects/vl-sigv4-*/*
Copyright:
  2026 Valkyrian Labs LLC <cooper@valkyrianlabs.com>
License: MIT
Comment:
 vl-sigv4 (https://github.com/valkyrianlabs/vl-sigv4), the AWS SigV4 library
 statically linked into vaulthalla-server, built from the release tarball
 pinned in subprojects/vl-sigv4.wrap.

Files: subprojects/packagecache/vl-keykit-*.tar.xz
       subprojects/vl-keykit-*/*
Copyright:
  2026 Valkyrian Labs LLC <cooper@valkyrianlabs.com>
License: MIT
Comment:
 vl-keykit (https://github.com/valkyrianlabs/vl-keykit), the KEV1 key envelope,
 recovery seed and recovery kit library statically linked into vaulthalla-server
 and vh-recovery, built from the release tarball pinned in
 subprojects/vl-keykit.wrap.

Files: subprojects/packagecache/vl-webauthn-*.tar.xz
       subprojects/vl-webauthn-*/*
Copyright:
  2026 Valkyrian Labs LLC <cooper@valkyrianlabs.com>
License: MIT
Comment:
 vl-webauthn (https://github.com/valkyrianlabs/vl-webauthn), the WebAuthn
 relying-party verifier statically linked into vaulthalla-server, built from
 the release tarball pinned in subprojects/vl-webauthn.wrap.

Files: deploy/password-lists/common-passwords.txt
Copyright:
  2018 Daniel Miessler
License: MIT
Comment:
 "100k-most-used-passwords-NCSC.txt" from SecLists
 (https://github.com/danielmiessler/SecLists, commit
 1a7bb9127eca9e6ff2fc0301c597fe6e16a0cb56), the UK NCSC's list of the
 100,000 most common passwords in the Have I Been Pwned corpus. Installed as
 /usr/share/vaulthalla/password-lists/common-passwords.txt. Provenance and
 checksums: deploy/password-lists/README.md.

Files: deploy/password-lists/dictionary.txt
Copyright:
  2000-2011 Kevin Atkinson
License: SCOWL
Comment:
 Derived from SCOWL size 50 (american-english, Debian package wamerican
 2020.12.07-2): words of three or more ASCII letters, lowercased and
 de-duplicated. Installed as
 /usr/share/vaulthalla/password-lists/dictionary.txt. Provenance and the
 derivation command: deploy/password-lists/README.md.

